#. §4: `IsMaxSpec`
#. §5: `max`
#. §6: `f a b`
#. §7: `a`
#. §8: `b`
#. §9: `a`
#. §10: `b`
#: Game/Levels/Specification/L05_StrongEnoughToPinItDown.lean:10
