"\n"
"The strengthened specification admits exactly one implementation: any function satisfying it\n"
"is §1."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `IsMaxSpec`
#. §1: `max`
#. §2: `max`
#: Game/Levels/Specification/L05_StrongEnoughToPinItDown.lean:36
