msgstr ""

#. §0: `max`
#. §1: `IsUpperBound`
#: Game/Levels/Specification/L05_StrongEnoughToPinItDown.lean:54
msgid "Every implementation of this contract is §0. The specification is tight.\n"
"\n"
"That is the standard you are aiming at, and it is worth saying plainly what it costs. Writing\n"
"a contract that *admits* your implementation is easy and nearly worthless; §1 did\n"
"that. Writing one that *excludes everything else* is the work, and the way to check you have\n"
