msgstr ""

#: Game/Levels/Specification/L06_ASpecificationNothingCanSatisfy.lean:8
msgid "A Specification Nothing Can Satisfy"
msgstr ""

#. §0: `f : List ℕ → ℕ`
#. §1: `f xs < xs.length`
#. §2: `xs`
#. §3: `[]`
#. §4: `f []`
#. §5: `0`
#. §6: `rintro ⟨f, hf⟩`
#. §7: `hf`
#: Game/Levels/Specification/L06_ASpecificationNothingCanSatisfy.lean:10
