"§1."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `«{h}»`
#. §1: `[].length`
#. §2: `0`
#. §3: `simp at h`
#: Game/Levels/Specification/L06_ASpecificationNothingCanSatisfy.lean:41
msgid "§0 now says some natural number is smaller than §1, which is §2.\n"
"§3 evaluates the length and finds the contradiction."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `IsUpperBound`
#. §1: `xs ≠ []`
#. §2: `Option ℕ`
#: Game/Levels/Specification/L06_ASpecificationNothingCanSatisfy.lean:45
msgid "The contract is not merely hard to meet — it is impossible, and the empty list is the whole\n"
"reason.\n"
"\n"
"Both failures you have now seen come from the same place: the contract and the intention came\n"
"apart at a case nobody pictured. Too weak, and §0 let through a function that\n"
"overshoots. Too strong, and this one lets through nothing at all. Neither mistake is visible\n"
