#: Game/Levels/Specification.lean:4
msgid "Specify Correct Behavior"
msgstr ""

#: Game/Levels/Specification.lean:6
msgid "You can now describe what a program does. This world is about saying what it *should* do.\n"
"\n"
"A specification in Lean is an ordinary proposition: a precondition on the input, a\n"
"postcondition relating input to output, and an arrow between them. No separate program logic,\n"
"no Hoare triples — for a pure function the arrow *is* the contract.\n"
