msgstr ""

#. §0: `intro d' htr`
#. §1: `simp_all`
#. §2: `cases d <;> cases n <;> cases μ <;> cases d' <;> simp_all [delayed, direct, matchDN]`
#: Game/Levels/Refinement/L09_AStepNobodyCanSee.lean:63
